sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor You
    participant AI as AI client
    participant MCP as MCP tools
    participant Srv as Media server
    AI->>MCP: request_library_delete(kind, path)
    MCP->>Srv: look at the item (read only)
    MCP-->>AI: exactly what would go + a one-time code
    AI->>You: show the item, ask for approval
    You->>AI: approve that item
    AI->>MCP: confirm_library_delete(code)
    MCP->>Srv: delete inside the library only
    MCP-->>AI: done
    Note over MCP,Srv: Nothing is deleted before step 6
